Here's your push key so you can push gems to any of your namespaces.

It expires in 24 hours and has replaced an existing active key, if any.

<%= @push_key.token %>

You can pass it to push/release commands, like this:

  <%= Peak::Command.gem_push @push_key.token, namespace_url(@namespace) %>
  <%= Peak::Command.rake_release @push_key.token, namespace_url(@namespace) %>

You can request a new push key here, we've prefilled your email address:

  <%= new_user_push_key_url(@push_key.user.slice(:email_address)) %>
